\[\frac{d}{d\eta}I(V_i,V_j)=f(\eta,\sigma,\lambda_W,p_{fix})=0,\]
so that
\[I(V_i,V_j;\eta)=I(V_i,V_j;0)=0\] for all \(\eta\ge0\).  The integral condition in the conjecture
